    "Reuse the general convolution and approximate-identity owners for Euclidean heat evolution.",
    "Separate scalar radial diffusion from vector swirl diffusion and keep the cylindrical inverse-square term.",
    "State initial-value and smoothing results in their actual data classes; do not assert uniform time-zero convergence for arbitrary Linfinity data.",
